(7576949, 1217393, 103142, '<td valign="top">Ha! Ok, I love the shot. Can''t talk myself into giving it a high score and can''t talk myself out of giving it a high score. Trying convince myself that he''s blue because he''s off by himself. I''ll let you know what I decide later. :)</td>', 'Ha! Ok, I love the shot. Can''t talk myself into giving it a high score and can''t talk myself out of giving it a high score. Trying convince myself that he''s blue because he''s off by himself. I''ll let you know what I decide later. :)', '2018-07-03 23:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7576953, 1217529, 103142, '<td valign="top">Too tight of a crop, imo. I would have liked the steam from the snout and the fire under and even some space above.</td>', 'Too tight of a crop, imo. I would have liked the steam from the snout and the fire under and even some space above.', '2018-07-03 23:38:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7576954, 1216853, 103142, '<td valign="top">Great shot of the mountain -- but some really weird stuff going on in the sky. Did you try some sort of circular gradient? You''re getting some odd stripes...</td>', 'Great shot of the mountain -- but some really weird stuff going on in the sky. Did you try some sort of circular gradient? You''re getting some odd stripes...', '2018-07-03 23:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7576961, 1217393, 81362, '<td valign="top">Well, you got me to look in Wikipedia to learn about this critter. I had not known about the distinctions between black wildebeest and blue wildebeest. Thanks.</td>', 'Well, you got me to look in Wikipedia to learn about this critter. I had not known about the distinctions between black wildebeest and blue wildebeest. Thanks.', '2018-07-04 00:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7576962, 1216730, 81362, '<td valign="top">Nice composition of spherical berries, round dish, and linear background patterns. <br/>Glad to see the berries more blue than grey.</td>', 'Nice composition of spherical berries, round dish, and linear background patterns. Glad to see the berries more blue than grey.', '2018-07-04 00:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7576963, 1217188, 81362, '<td valign="top">Good sharp detail and lots of blue. Getting a shot like this is not easy. High score from me.</td>', 'Good sharp detail and lots of blue. Getting a shot like this is not easy. High score from me.', '2018-07-04 00:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7576966, 1217488, 81362, '<td valign="top">Calm and artistic with fine shades of blue. Although I try to evaluate images on their own before considering the title, I do find that a well selected title can add value. As you know, uploading to DPC populates the title field with the file name as a default, but that field is available for revision as a next step. Something more evocative could be useful.</td>', 'Calm and artistic with fine shades of blue. Although I try to evaluate images on their own before considering the title, I do find that a well selected title can add value. As you know, uploading to DPC populates the title field with the file name as a default, but that field is available for revision as a next step. Something more evocative could be useful.', '2018-07-04 00:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7576967, 1217486, 81362, '<td valign="top">I''d say Grandma made excellent choices when selecting crockery.</td>', 'I''d say Grandma made excellent choices when selecting crockery.', '2018-07-04 00:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7576969, 1217297, 81362, '<td valign="top">The water, sky, and dress work well. Unfortunately, highlighting the blue porta-toilets evokes olfactory memories that are not favorable.</td>', 'The water, sky, and dress work well. Unfortunately, highlighting the blue porta-toilets evokes olfactory memories that are not favorable.', '2018-07-04 00:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7576971, 1217447, 81362, '<td valign="top">Very good portrait, with worm adding interest.</td>', 'Very good portrait, with worm adding interest.', '2018-07-04 00:23:34.000000', NULL, 1),
