(7577301, 1217090, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Love the close-up of the jeans bringing me closer to examine all the wonderful details, color hues, and textures of this clothing!! Your title made me curious so I did look at IMDB - interesting that there are two films, one blue and one yellow and both of those colors are present in this picture.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Love the close-up of the jeans bringing me closer to examine all the wonderful details, color hues, and textures of this clothing!! Your title made me curious so I did look at IMDB - interesting that there are two films, one blue and one yellow and both of those colors are present in this picture.', '2018-07-04 16:02:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7577302, 1216805, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Beautiful capture and mood in this photograph! It speaks of the early morning blues where a cool breeze washes ashore. The ocean waves roll in as two people walk together on an empty beach sharing the moment of tranquility as they stroll towards the sleeping city.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Beautiful capture and mood in this photograph! It speaks of the early morning blues where a cool breeze washes ashore. The ocean waves roll in as two people walk together on an empty beach sharing the moment of tranquility as they stroll towards the sleeping city.', '2018-07-04 16:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7577303, 1217310, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>This is a beautiful floral still life! I love the pops of color of white and yellow flowers and the greenery that flows/grows out of that lovely sky blue pitcher.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. This is a beautiful floral still life! I love the pops of color of white and yellow flowers and the greenery that flows/grows out of that lovely sky blue pitcher.', '2018-07-04 16:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7577306, 1217431, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>I love all the details I can see in this dandelion seed that rests in a pool of water. The reflection is quite lovely. Another wonderful little touch is all the little dewdrops of water that adorn the silky filaments of the dandelion seed.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. I love all the details I can see in this dandelion seed that rests in a pool of water. The reflection is quite lovely. Another wonderful little touch is all the little dewdrops of water that adorn the silky filaments of the dandelion seed.', '2018-07-04 16:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7577317, 1217351, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Well seen and captured! I love this overhead shot of this lady swimming across the length of a pool. The blue tiles give the water a rich hue and textured dimension. The woman''s bathing suit is a nice pop of color that contrasts wonderfully with all the blue. This capture is so visually captivating to me - the swimmer moves forward leaving waves of ripples in the water''s surface. To me she is venturing out into the blue.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Well seen and captured! I love this overhead shot of this lady swimming across the length of a pool. The blue tiles give the water a rich hue and textured dimension. The woman''s bathing suit is a nice pop of color that contrasts wonderfully with all the blue. This capture is so visually captivating to me - the swimmer moves forward leaving waves of ripples in the water''s surface. To me she is venturing out into the blue.', '2018-07-04 16:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
