(7577680, 1217486, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Wonderful arrangement of stacked circular shapes in this abstract piece! Bold blue and patterns that capture the eye''s attention - well done!</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Wonderful arrangement of stacked circular shapes in this abstract piece! Bold blue and patterns that capture the eye''s attention - well done!', '2018-07-05 20:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7577682, 1217581, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>What a whimsical and wonderful find! I love the sense of play here - both with the fun the boys are having as they play and this fantastical playground. Enter the blue and have loads of fun too!</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. What a whimsical and wonderful find! I love the sense of play here - both with the fun the boys are having as they play and this fantastical playground. Enter the blue and have loads of fun too!', '2018-07-05 20:58:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7577684, 1216730, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Blues all around and wonderfully presented in this food photography shot. The lighting, details and angle are fantastic. The beautiful blue bowl full with these tasty blueberries are offered to the viewer - inviting one to take some. Well done!</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Blues all around and wonderfully presented in this food photography shot. The lighting, details and angle are fantastic. The beautiful blue bowl full with these tasty blueberries are offered to the viewer - inviting one to take some. Well done!', '2018-07-05 21:05:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7577688, 1217550, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Great composition! I like how the nearly full moon rises next to the nest of Great Blue Herons. Great details on all the herons that are perched in the nest. A big plus that you captured the shot with the whole family; the two parents keeping watch and the two young ones between them.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Great composition! I like how the nearly full moon rises next to the nest of Great Blue Herons. Great details on all the herons that are perched in the nest. A big plus that you captured the shot with the whole family; the two parents keeping watch and the two young ones between them.', '2018-07-05 21:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7577692, 1217060, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Got to love those distinctive clouds that streak towards the horizon. Not only do they add beauty to the composition but they act as leading lines to draw the eye in. They are the pathways in the blue sky leading to the sunset. The cherry on top is the several seabirds that take flight in this pleasing seascape shot. Well done!</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Got to love those distinctive clouds that streak towards the horizon. Not only do they add beauty to the composition but they act as leading lines to draw the eye in. They are the pathways in the blue sky leading to the sunset. The cherry on top is the several seabirds that take flight in this pleasing seascape shot. Well done!', '2018-07-05 21:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7577857, 1217469, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Love the soft, pastel hues in this floral shot. Lighting and details are spot on. Great composition that centers the focus on one flower in the field giving the viewer a lovely sight to gaze upon.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Love the soft, pastel hues in this floral shot. Lighting and details are spot on. Great composition that centers the focus on one flower in the field giving the viewer a lovely sight to gaze upon.', '2018-07-06 11:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7577858, 1217484, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Love the low angle which makes this off road automobile fill more of the frame and take center stage. The angle also shows off the grasslands, the mountains in the backdrop and the stormy clouds threatening rain. Though battered and rusted, this blue car promises the comfort of staying dry while observing the view of the rural country.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Love the low angle which makes this off road automobile fill more of the frame and take center stage. The angle also shows off the grasslands, the mountains in the backdrop and the stormy clouds threatening rain. Though battered and rusted, this blue car promises the comfort of staying dry while observing the view of the rural country.', '2018-07-06 11:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7577859, 1216548, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Love the framing where the overhead view of this blue flower give it the appearance of the petals bursting forth from the center. Great details too for I see the lovely textures on the petals as well as the center yellow. The droplets add another layer of visual interest along with the great pops of color of blue and yellow.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Love the framing where the overhead view of this blue flower give it the appearance of the petals bursting forth from the center. Great details too for I see the lovely textures on the petals as well as the center yellow. The droplets add another layer of visual interest along with the great pops of color of blue and yellow.', '2018-07-06 11:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7577860, 1217547, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>What an awesome sight! Love the overhead view that gives me the unique bird''s eye view of the island below, the below the shoreline, the ocean and the boat! Great title too! There are fantastic details for my eye to explore from the grassy areas on land to the rocky areas going down into the ocean depths. This is a really unique and cool view of the land and sea. Well done!</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. What an awesome sight! Love the overhead view that gives me the unique bird''s eye view of the island below, the below the shoreline, the ocean and the boat! Great title too! There are fantastic details for my eye to explore from the grassy areas on land to the rocky areas going down into the ocean depths. This is a really unique and cool view of the land and sea. Well done!', '2018-07-06 11:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7577861, 1217577, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Love how the light sparkles and shines in the stacked sea glass of blues and greens. The bokeh circles also are quite lovely and add to the daydreaming on the beach feel and mood.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Love how the light sparkles and shines in the stacked sea glass of blues and greens. The bokeh circles also are quite lovely and add to the daydreaming on the beach feel and mood.', '2018-07-06 11:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
