(7578189, 1217447, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Great capture of this bluebird! Great details here from each and every feather to the worms in the beak! This is also a very serendipitous capture for you caught this ''early'' bird with breakfast in his/her beak.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Great capture of this bluebird! Great details here from each and every feather to the worms in the beak! This is also a very serendipitous capture for you caught this ''early'' bird with breakfast in his/her beak.', '2018-07-07 12:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7578191, 1216718, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Love the rich and vibrant blues of this daisy floating on the water. Fantastic details too as that center section of the flower and the petals have tack sharp clarity showing shape, pattern and texture. The bokeh shimmer on the blue water is a nice visual touch too. Nicely done!</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Love the rich and vibrant blues of this daisy floating on the water. Fantastic details too as that center section of the flower and the petals have tack sharp clarity showing shape, pattern and texture. The bokeh shimmer on the blue water is a nice visual touch too. Nicely done!', '2018-07-07 12:37:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7578193, 1217620, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Great balance of light and shadow to compliment the mood of sadness in this portrait shot! The man is sits with hand on head and furrows on his forehead in a pose that conveys worry and sadness. The blue tones with the weathered texture on the wall strengthen the overall mood projecting the emotions within - feeling blue, feeling down and sad.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Great balance of light and shadow to compliment the mood of sadness in this portrait shot! The man is sits with hand on head and furrows on his forehead in a pose that conveys worry and sadness. The blue tones with the weathered texture on the wall strengthen the overall mood projecting the emotions within - feeling blue, feeling down and sad.', '2018-07-07 12:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7578202, 1216823, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Love the weathered and worn blue color of the shutters of this building. The blue contrasts beautifully with the white and the reds. Love all the details I can see with the architectural elements of this house. I love the title for one could  anthropomorphize the windows as open mouths gabbing about what so and so did or said. As the saying goes, ''If these walls could talk, the stories they would tell''.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Love the weathered and worn blue color of the shutters of this building. The blue contrasts beautifully with the white and the reds. Love all the details I can see with the architectural elements of this house. I love the title for one could  anthropomorphize the windows as open mouths gabbing about what so and so did or said. As the saying goes, ''If these walls could talk, the stories they would tell''.', '2018-07-07 12:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7578212, 1216617, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Wonderful lighting and details in this composition! I like how you composed all the elements in this still life - this photo really is ''eye candy''. The candy ''pours'' out of the open glass jar and the wavy blue lines of the backdrop ''pour'' into the metal cap (which would be a great ''dish'' to carry a bunch of these jellybeans).</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Wonderful lighting and details in this composition! I like how you composed all the elements in this still life - this photo really is ''eye candy''. The candy ''pours'' out of the open glass jar and the wavy blue lines of the backdrop ''pour'' into the metal cap (which would be a great ''dish'' to carry a bunch of these jellybeans).', '2018-07-07 13:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7578213, 1216983, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Love the blue tones throughout this stunning night time cityscape! The mood is magical with the city lights twinkling in the darkness seen in the rolling hills behind the tall building in the forefront of the photo. One can just distinguish the outline of a mountain region far off in the distance as the haze/clouds roll in. What a beautiful sight to observe - well done!</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Love the blue tones throughout this stunning night time cityscape! The mood is magical with the city lights twinkling in the darkness seen in the rolling hills behind the tall building in the forefront of the photo. One can just distinguish the outline of a mountain region far off in the distance as the haze/clouds roll in. What a beautiful sight to observe - well done!', '2018-07-07 13:10:09.000000', NULL, 1),
