(7578704, 1216441, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Great capture of this leaping lady as she leaps into the air. The action is freeze framed great with some water droplets coming off her feet and the dress billowing. Pose of the model invokes the idea of taking flight with the head up, back arched and arms straight back. I have one suggestion to strengthen the imagery of ''taking flight''. Take the shot at a lower angle with camera looking up - with a low angle the model will look like she is still leaping from the water but her flight will be into the sky rather than still in the water.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Great capture of this leaping lady as she leaps into the air. The action is freeze framed great with some water droplets coming off her feet and the dress billowing. Pose of the model invokes the idea of taking flight with the head up, back arched and arms straight back. I have one suggestion to strengthen the imagery of ''taking flight''. Take the shot at a lower angle with camera looking up - with a low angle the model will look like she is still leaping from the water but her flight will be into the sky rather than still in the water.', '2018-07-08 11:46:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7578708, 1217538, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Very lovely macro that shows off the beauty of this flower with the blue tipped petals. Lighting, colors, and details are great. My critique is that the composition could be stronger. The center portion of the flower is in the bottom center of the frame and as such the photo feels ''static''. If you compose the center portion of the flower in a 45 degree angle in the bottom left corner the petals would ''appear'' like they are bursting forth from that corner ''tricking'' or giving the eye the impression of movement.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Very lovely macro that shows off the beauty of this flower with the blue tipped petals. Lighting, colors, and details are great. My critique is that the composition could be stronger. The center portion of the flower is in the bottom center of the frame and as such the photo feels ''static''. If you compose the center portion of the flower in a 45 degree angle in the bottom left corner the petals would ''appear'' like they are bursting forth from that corner ''tricking'' or giving the eye the impression of movement.', '2018-07-08 11:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7578717, 1217534, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>I love the fairytale/storybook feel of this photo! The princess proudly and confidently walks in the forest unafraid of any creature she may encounter. Why? Because she will blast with her vuvuzela horn! The vuvuzela is a mean weapon;-) But for the blue challenge, there is very little blue here in a mostly forest of green. I wish we could see more of the blue vuvuzela - some of it gets lost in shadow. You could try a New Adjustment Layer Fill Light/Clarity to brighten the dark areas - illuminating more of the horn. The dress was another opportunity to go for a solid blue or more prominent blue - I am not quite sure if it is a pale blue or pale violet with all the white daisy print. That critique aside - I think you should pursue this idea and make it a short photo fairytale series to tell the story of the princess with her horn traveling to distant lands where danger sometimes lurks.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. I love the fairytale/storybook feel of this photo! The princess proudly and confidently walks in the forest unafraid of any creature she may encounter. Why? Because she will blast with her vuvuzela horn! The vuvuzela is a mean weapon;-) But for the blue challenge, there is very little blue here in a mostly forest of green. I wish we could see more of the blue vuvuzela - some of it gets lost in shadow. You could try a New Adjustment Layer Fill Light/Clarity to brighten the dark areas - illuminating more of the horn. The dress was another opportunity to go for a solid blue or more prominent blue - I am not quite sure if it is a pale blue or pale violet with all the white daisy print. That critique aside - I think you should pursue this idea and make it a short photo fairytale series to tell the story of the princess with her horn traveling to distant lands where danger sometimes lurks.', '2018-07-08 12:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7578722, 1216601, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Love this capture showcasing a moment in the day in the life of a house painter/contractor. It is just a slice of everyday life. I like how the vertical frame follows the height of the ladder giving the viewer the sight of seeing not one but two men at work. Great light, great details, and great composition of main subject - nicely done!</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Love this capture showcasing a moment in the day in the life of a house painter/contractor. It is just a slice of everyday life. I like how the vertical frame follows the height of the ladder giving the viewer the sight of seeing not one but two men at work. Great light, great details, and great composition of main subject - nicely done!', '2018-07-08 12:17:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7578725, 1216518, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Love the low angle which makes that tower rather imposing. The tower is also perfectly framed under the neon arch that stretches over the street marketplace. Blue lights, blue neon signs light up the night. I feel like I am taking a night stroll in this marketplace. The mood, the lighting, the place - yes, this does take on the feel of being in one of the city streets in Blade Runner. Fantastic capture and well done!</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Love the low angle which makes that tower rather imposing. The tower is also perfectly framed under the neon arch that stretches over the street marketplace. Blue lights, blue neon signs light up the night. I feel like I am taking a night stroll in this marketplace. The mood, the lighting, the place - yes, this does take on the feel of being in one of the city streets in Blade Runner. Fantastic capture and well done!', '2018-07-08 12:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7578727, 1217115, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Fantastic capture of this bird in a field of blue flowers! Lighting, color, and detail are pretty spot on. I do have one suggestion on how to further strengthen the composition. The flowers in the forefront that are hazy blurred due to depth of field can be cropped out. That hazy blur in the forefront of the frame tends to distract from the overall scene. Cropping as much as you can out will keep the focus on the bird at rest in the field of Lupinus.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Fantastic capture of this bird in a field of blue flowers! Lighting, color, and detail are pretty spot on. I do have one suggestion on how to further strengthen the composition. The flowers in the forefront that are hazy blurred due to depth of field can be cropped out. That hazy blur in the forefront of the frame tends to distract from the overall scene. Cropping as much as you can out will keep the focus on the bird at rest in the field of Lupinus.', '2018-07-08 12:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7578733, 1217056, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Now this is not a sight you see everyday! Unique and strange but very interesting to look at. Composition is great for you give the viewer a close up view of some of these polistyrene heads with the stand out for visual interest one had a white helmet. Details and color are fantastic - I can see all the wear and tear and ''pores'' on these styrofoam model heads. The light and shadows are great too with my only critique being I wish the picture was a little brighter overall.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Now this is not a sight you see everyday! Unique and strange but very interesting to look at. Composition is great for you give the viewer a close up view of some of these polistyrene heads with the stand out for visual interest one had a white helmet. Details and color are fantastic - I can see all the wear and tear and ''pores'' on these styrofoam model heads. The light and shadows are great too with my only critique being I wish the picture was a little brighter overall.', '2018-07-08 12:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7578767, 1217431, 121949, '<td valign="top">Beautiful...one of my top scores for this challenge. Love the soft blue colors and how it is sharp but soft at the same time.</td>', 'Beautiful...one of my top scores for this challenge. Love the soft blue colors and how it is sharp but soft at the same time.', '2018-07-08 13:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7578786, 1217463, 149964, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful and one of my favourites.</td>', 'This is beautiful and one of my favourites.', '2018-07-08 14:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7578787, 1217624, 149964, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous shades of blue and I really like the sense of depth that it portrays.</td>', 'Gorgeous shades of blue and I really like the sense of depth that it portrays.', '2018-07-08 14:13:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7578789, 1217625, 149964, '<td valign="top">Not only a clever idea but beautifully presented as well. I love the depth of blue in this.</td>', 'Not only a clever idea but beautifully presented as well. I love the depth of blue in this.', '2018-07-08 14:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7578792, 1217115, 149964, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous colour in the flowers. A slight niggle is that there is so much going on that I think the bird gets a little lost. I wonder if you could have balanced a tighter crop with the need to keep the sense of blue?</td>', 'Gorgeous colour in the flowers. A slight niggle is that there is so much going on that I think the bird gets a little lost. I wonder if you could have balanced a tighter crop with the need to keep the sense of blue?', '2018-07-08 14:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7578794, 1216617, 149964, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shades of blue and I love the ''flow'' of the colours. I''m wondering if it might have looked a bit cleaner without the lid? A lovely image.</td>', 'Beautiful shades of blue and I love the ''flow'' of the colours. I''m wondering if it might have looked a bit cleaner without the lid? A lovely image.', '2018-07-08 14:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7578797, 1216823, 149964, '<td valign="top">I really liked the contrast between the blue windows and the woodwork. Lots of lovely textures.</td>', 'I really liked the contrast between the blue windows and the woodwork. Lots of lovely textures.', '2018-07-08 14:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7578799, 1217501, 149964, '<td valign="top">There''s a great sense of ''futurism'' in this image. I could imagine it on the front of a book about the impact of man on the environment. I love the ''softness'' to the colours</td>', 'There''s a great sense of ''futurism'' in this image. I could imagine it on the front of a book about the impact of man on the environment. I love the ''softness'' to the colours', '2018-07-08 14:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7578802, 1217462, 149964, '<td valign="top">Lots of great lines and angles on this.</td>', 'Lots of great lines and angles on this.', '2018-07-08 14:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7578809, 1216818, 149964, '<td valign="top">This is such a great ''societal'' image; it''s as though we''ve met, but in fact I think it must be a reflection of so many other people I know merged into this one portrait.</td>', 'This is such a great ''societal'' image; it''s as though we''ve met, but in fact I think it must be a reflection of so many other people I know merged into this one portrait.', '2018-07-08 14:27:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7578810, 1217129, 149964, '<td valign="top">Striking clarity, crispness and BLUE!</td>', 'Striking clarity, crispness and BLUE!', '2018-07-08 14:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7578814, 1217076, 149964, '<td valign="top">Beautiful crisp image and those pancakes look SO delicious! Personally I was looking for more about the ''blue'' in the challenges which is why I''ve not given it a higher score.</td>', 'Beautiful crisp image and those pancakes look SO delicious! Personally I was looking for more about the ''blue'' in the challenges which is why I''ve not given it a higher score.', '2018-07-08 14:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7578818, 1216840, 149964, '<td valign="top">I love the subject of this and he dreamy colours. Personally I would have preferred it to be a little sharper and there to have been a stronger sense of blue - perhaps an adjustment to the background?</td>', 'I love the subject of this and he dreamy colours. Personally I would have preferred it to be a little sharper and there to have been a stronger sense of blue - perhaps an adjustment to the background?', '2018-07-08 14:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7578824, 1217306, 149964, '<td valign="top">A clever choice of topic and nice and crisp. I''m afraid it didn''t really excite me though - I''d have liked something to lift it or a subject within it that my eye could rest on.</td>', 'A clever choice of topic and nice and crisp. I''m afraid it didn''t really excite me though - I''d have liked something to lift it or a subject within it that my eye could rest on.', '2018-07-08 14:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7578826, 1217527, 149964, '<td valign="top">What incredible eyes! I liked this image but there''s something about the lighting that bothered me; one day, when I''m better at this sort of thing, I might be able to put it into words a bit better!</td>', 'What incredible eyes! I liked this image but there''s something about the lighting that bothered me; one day, when I''m better at this sort of thing, I might be able to put it into words a bit better!', '2018-07-08 14:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7578827, 1217393, 149964, '<td valign="top">What an amazing creature and how exciting to have seen it. I like the contrast between the pale grass and the dark trees. I think i''d have preferred to have had a bit more light on the head as the features are a little difficult to pick out.</td>', 'What an amazing creature and how exciting to have seen it. I like the contrast between the pale grass and the dark trees. I think i''d have preferred to have had a bit more light on the head as the features are a little difficult to pick out.', '2018-07-08 14:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7578829, 1217454, 149964, '<td valign="top">A great sense of blue! Personally I would have liked to have been able to settle my eye on something. The stone/rock wasn''t really enough to satisfy the need for a subject.</td>', 'A great sense of blue! Personally I would have liked to have been able to settle my eye on something. The stone/rock wasn''t really enough to satisfy the need for a subject.', '2018-07-08 14:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7578838, 1216664, 65234, '<td valign="top">Beautiful; almost looks like a sculpture.</td>', 'Beautiful; almost looks like a sculpture.', '2018-07-08 15:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7578840, 1217060, 65234, '<td valign="top">I like the clouds all drawing my eye in, and then the bonus of the seabirds. Would''ve been OK with just the distant seabirds, too. But more subtle.</td>', 'I like the clouds all drawing my eye in, and then the bonus of the seabirds. Would''ve been OK with just the distant seabirds, too. But more subtle.', '2018-07-08 15:09:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7578841, 1217620, 65234, '<td valign="top">VERY well done. The mood is palpable.</td>', 'VERY well done. The mood is palpable.', '2018-07-08 15:09:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7578842, 1217550, 65234, '<td valign="top">A whole family! How very cool to see.</td>', 'A whole family! How very cool to see.', '2018-07-08 15:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7578843, 1217496, 65234, '<td valign="top">Simple, but very pretty.</td>', 'Simple, but very pretty.', '2018-07-08 15:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7578844, 1217630, 65234, '<td valign="top">Always fun to see an excited child entranced by wildlife, even if it''s in a zoo/aquarium. The seal seems to be dancing, too.</td>', 'Always fun to see an excited child entranced by wildlife, even if it''s in a zoo/aquarium. The seal seems to be dancing, too.', '2018-07-08 15:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7578845, 1217188, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice flight capture.</td>', 'Nice flight capture.', '2018-07-08 15:11:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7578846, 1217084, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very clever!</td>', 'Very clever!', '2018-07-08 15:12:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7578848, 1217528, 144271, '<td valign="top">Nicely seen.  I love the pop of the bright parachute against the sky</td>', 'Nicely seen.  I love the pop of the bright parachute against the sky', '2018-07-08 15:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7578849, 1217454, 144271, '<td valign="top">Nice colors</td>', 'Nice colors', '2018-07-08 15:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7578850, 1216989, 65234, '<td valign="top">Oh, that does look like a gorgeous place. The wake makes for an interesting leading line.</td>', 'Oh, that does look like a gorgeous place. The wake makes for an interesting leading line.', '2018-07-08 15:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
