(7579001, 1216983, 138630, '<td valign="top">Sparkling and magical.  Whenever I see a city packed into a frame like this, I just think of all that humanity.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2018-07-09 00:20:09.</i></td>', 'Sparkling and magical.  Whenever I see a city packed into a frame like this, I just think of all that humanity.', '2018-07-08 19:04:00.000000', '2018-07-09 01:20:09.000000', 1),
