(7579012, 1216679, 138630, '<td valign="top">Not sure how you did this, but I like it a lot.</td>', 'Not sure how you did this, but I like it a lot.', '2018-07-08 19:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7579013, 1217572, 138630, '<td valign="top">Very cool take on the challenge.</td>', 'Very cool take on the challenge.', '2018-07-08 19:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7579091, 1217187, 103142, '<td valign="top">Whoa... Didn''t expect to like a shot that wasn''t just naturally blue. But this is spectacular! Well done, and well done for getting me out of what I expected. -9-</td>', 'Whoa... Didn''t expect to like a shot that wasn''t just naturally blue. But this is spectacular! Well done, and well done for getting me out of what I expected. -9-', '2018-07-08 21:18:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7579092, 1216601, 103142, '<td valign="top">It''s the legs and shoes of the guy on the top that makes this shot. So many people would have either cropped him out or taken the shot with the whole guy. Your composition and cropping is brilliant! Thanks!</td>', 'It''s the legs and shoes of the guy on the top that makes this shot. So many people would have either cropped him out or taken the shot with the whole guy. Your composition and cropping is brilliant! Thanks!', '2018-07-08 21:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7579093, 1216786, 103142, '<td valign="top">I had some shots that were predominantly blue, but where the subject wasn''t, and I wasn''t sure how people would react. This works for me. I''ll be curious to see where it ends up. I like the composition. Not leaving a lot of room to look out and yet having the whole lid back behind give it a feeling of movement or intensity. Nicely done.</td>', 'I had some shots that were predominantly blue, but where the subject wasn''t, and I wasn''t sure how people would react. This works for me. I''ll be curious to see where it ends up. I like the composition. Not leaving a lot of room to look out and yet having the whole lid back behind give it a feeling of movement or intensity. Nicely done.', '2018-07-08 21:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7579094, 1217076, 103142, '<td valign="top">Ok -- it doesn''t really say "blue" to me, but it is blueberries, so it really does fit, even if it doesn''t meet my definition of the challenge. and it made my mouth water. So the first reaction was 5, but second thought was -7-, so I''ll go with the 7. Might move it to 8 later if I still really want to eat the pancake. :)</td>', 'Ok -- it doesn''t really say "blue" to me, but it is blueberries, so it really does fit, even if it doesn''t meet my definition of the challenge. and it made my mouth water. So the first reaction was 5, but second thought was -7-, so I''ll go with the 7. Might move it to 8 later if I still really want to eat the pancake. :)', '2018-07-08 21:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
